From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bartosz Nitka <niteria@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 12:54:46 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: pci: apple,pcie: add a root port's
 CLKREQ# GPIO

The J713's native radio port names its endpoint's CLKREQ# pin, which
the host returns to an input after a deep sleep has reset the pin
controller, before it trains the link again.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Bartosz Nitka <niteria@gmail.com>
(cherry picked from commit a7ba23c74bda95280db628b6017479be5c9454a6)
Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pci/apple,pcie.yaml | 7 +++++++
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pci/apple,pcie.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pci/apple,pcie.yaml
index f9098d6e0a..dbd47f5075 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pci/apple,pcie.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pci/apple,pcie.yaml
@@ -243,6 +243,13 @@ patternProperties:
         description: Optional GPIO to power on the device
         maxItems: 1
 
+      clkreq-gpios:
+        description:
+          The endpoint's CLKREQ# line. After a deep sleep has reset the pin
+          controller, the host returns the pin to an input before it trains
+          the link again.
+        maxItems: 1
+
       interrupt-controller: true
 
       apple,link-trained-by-bootloader:
-- 
2.43.0

